    coreHi: '==Class== ek template hai jisme `__init__` aur methods hote hain, aur ==object== uska live instance. ==`@dataclass`== `DocumentChunk` jaise data objects ko super-clean banata hai.',
    analogyTitle: 'ID Card Template vs Your Personal ID Card',
    analogyEn: 'The template has fields `name`, `role`, `id` (`class`). Your printed card with your photo and name is the live `object`.',
