    jobUse: 'Modeling `DocumentChunk`, `AgentState`, `ToolResult`, and `EvalCase` cleanly.',
    mistake: 'Putting mutable lists as class-level attributes (shared across all instances!) instead of inside `__init__`.',
    proHabit: 'Use `@dataclass` or Pydantic `BaseModel` for every structured record in your AI app.',
